Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.03,0:00:01.00,Short,,0,0,0,,A gecko could hang
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.74,Short,,0,0,0,,from your ceiling
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.74,0:00:02.46,Short,,0,0,0,,all day
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.46,0:00:04.01,Short,,0,0,0,,with no glue at all
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.01,0:00:05.62,Short,,0,0,0,,Look closer at its toes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.15,0:00:06.58,Short,,0,0,0,,They're lined
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.58,0:00:07.50,Short,,0,0,0,,with ridges
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.50,0:00:08.36,Short,,0,0,0,,covered in about
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.36,0:00:10.08,Short,,0,0,0,,two million tiny hairs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.40,0:00:11.54,Short,,0,0,0,,Each hair splits into
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.54,0:00:12.12,Short,,0,0,0,,hundreds of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.12,0:00:13.44,Short,,0,0,0,,even tinier tips
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.70,0:00:14.60,Short,,0,0,0,,They're so small
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.60,0:00:15.58,Short,,0,0,0,,they get close enough
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.58,0:00:16.40,Short,,0,0,0,,for the molecules
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.40,0:00:17.00,Short,,0,0,0,,themselves
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.00,0:00:18.16,Short,,0,0,0,,to pull together
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.43,0:00:19.22,Short,,0,0,0,,A patch of hairs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.22,0:00:20.52,Short,,0,0,0,,the size of a coin
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.52,0:00:21.04,Short,,0,0,0,,could lift
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.04,0:00:22.26,Short,,0,0,0,,a small child
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.62,0:00:23.62,Short,,0,0,0,,To let go
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.62,0:00:24.58,Short,,0,0,0,,a gecko simply
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.58,0:00:25.98,Short,,0,0,0,,peels its toes back
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.98,0:00:26.71,Short,,0,0,0,,like tape
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.71,0:00:27.68,Short,,0,0,0,,up to fifteen
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.68,0:00:29.09,Short,,0,0,0,,times a second
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.09,0:00:30.10,Short,,0,0,0,,So if one ever lands
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.10,0:00:30.90,Short,,0,0,0,,on your ceiling
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.90,0:00:31.52,Short,,0,0,0,,don't wait
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.52,0:00:32.32,Short,,0,0,0,,for it to fall
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.32,0:00:32.77,Short,,0,0,0,,because
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.60,0:00:28.90,Prompt,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,250)}Send this to someone\Nwho's scared of lizards
